GlobalPlatform 8.0.0 / GPShell 3.0.0

* Add SCP11a secure-channel workflows and certificate handling.
* Add delegated management, DAP, receipt verification, and ECC key support.
* Add Windows shared-library SDK packaging with CMake package exports.
* Update bundled zlib to 1.3.1 and fix Windows 32-bit error-code handling.

Previous releases

* Support for CAT/STK ETSI TS 102 226 installation parameters.

